# React Native UI Components

When generating UI components for this project, always use the Headless UI approach combining `@rn-primitives/*` and `react-native-unistyles`.

## Guidelines

1. **Location:** All custom primitive-based UI components must be placed in `src/components/ui/`.
2. **Wrapper:** Wrap `rn-primitives` components using `React.forwardRef`.
3. **Styling:** Import `StyleSheet` from `react-native-unistyles` (do NOT use `useStyles` or `createStyleSheet`).
4. **Style Definition:** Define styles at the bottom of the file using `const styles = StyleSheet.create((theme) => ({ ... }))`.
5. **Types:** Expose necessary props and extend `React.ComponentPropsWithoutRef<typeof Primitive.Root>`.
6. **Props merging:** Always merge passed `style` prop with your custom unistyles root style `[styles.root, style]`.

## Component Template

```tsx
import React from 'react';
import * as ComponentPrimitive from '@rn-primitives/component-name';
import { StyleSheet } from 'react-native-unistyles';

export const Component = React.forwardRef<
  React.ElementRef<typeof ComponentPrimitive.Root>,
  React.ComponentPropsWithoutRef<typeof ComponentPrimitive.Root>
>(({ style, ...props }, ref) => {
  return (
    <ComponentPrimitive.Root
      ref={ref}
      style={[styles.root, style]}
      {...props}
    >
      {/* Internal components / indicators go here */}
      {props.children}
    </ComponentPrimitive.Root>
  );
});

Component.displayName = 'Component';

const styles = StyleSheet.create((theme) => ({
  root: {
    // Base styling here
  },
}));
```